  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ireland&apos;s Development Education Strategy aims to advance Irish Aid&#x2019;s vision for a sustainable and just world, by working with our partners to deepen citizens&#x2019; understanding of issues relating to global poverty and development, reflect on their responsibilities as global citizens and take action for a fairer and more sustainable future for all.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working towards a sustainable and just world, by supporting development education partners to deepen citizens&#x2019; understanding of issues relating to global poverty, injustice and development, reflect on their responsibilities as global citizens and take action for a fairer and more sustainable future for all.</narrative>
  </description>
